15. Automating CI/CD Pipelines using Lambda

Execution Steps
1.Create Lambda function
2.Add automation code
3.Create CodePipeline
4.Configure Lambda trigger
5.Start deployment process
6.Verify successful pipeline execution

Project Overview
Used AWS Lambda to automate CI/CD pipeline triggers and deployment tasks.

AWS Services Used
AWS Lambda
AWS CodePipeline

Features
Event-driven automation
Reduced manual deployment steps
Faster CI/CD execution

Architecture
Lambda Trigger → CodePipeline → Deployment
